/* iq2_xs_vecdot_fused.c -- OWNED FUSED iq2_xs grid vec_dot leaf: iq2_xs x q8_K (M=1).
 *
 * B线第二块 iq2_xs floor 攻坚 (未试挂号杠杆「归约批处理」·公式墙必攻).
 *
 * The deployed emit (emitIQ2XSSuperBlockGridBody, GridCodebook path) does 16x serial
 * vwredsum per super-block -- one per (sub-block, half) group -- because each of the 16
 * half-groups is reduced to a scalar BEFORE its per-half scale (ls1/ls2) is applied and
 * folded into bsum. That 16x serial reduction is the named floor (具名-X 0.62, ISSUE-109
 * vwredsum floor family / ISSUE-020 sum2 sign-sum vectorization). This leaf pulls the
 * REGISTERED reduction-batching lever, exactly as the tq1_0 P1 fused leaf collapsed 8x
 * vwredsum -> 1 (commit 4e8d46948):
 *
 *   Fold the per-half integer scale INTO each product (integer distributivity:
 *     bsum = SUM_h ls[h] * SUM_i q8*sw  =  SUM_all (q8 * sw) * ls[halfgroup])
 *   and accumulate every scaled product into ONE persistent 32-lane i32 accumulator via a
 *   widening MAC, then ONE vredsum per super-block. 16 vwredsum -> 8 vwmacc + 1 vredsum.
 *
 * BYTE-EXACT integer core to the deployed emit AND the ZERO-MODEL oracle by construction:
 *   identical grid gather (vluxei16 over the 512-entry iq2xs codebook), identical signs64
 *   sign fold, identical q8 index map. bsum is a pure order-free integer sum, so any
 *   accumulation order gives the same integer; the fp32 fold statement order matches the
 *   emit/oracle exactly (sumf += (dx*dy)*(float)bsum ; *s = 0.125f*sumf).
 *
 * PURE C-INTRINSIC. NO inline-asm, NO pinned schedule -- the opponent (_vl128) is
 * C-intrinsic (hand-tuned), so an owned C-intrinsic is on-position (公式墙 attack).
 * VLEN-UNIVERSAL: fixed vl (gather vl=4, byte/reduce vl=32), NO VLEN-dependent vget
 * (unlike the deployed _vl128 / the emit's vget_i8m1 splits which are VLEN128-specific).
 *
 * block_iq2_xs (74B): d(fp16)@0 ; qs[32](u16)@2 ; scales[8](u8)@66.  QK_K = 256.
 * block_q8_K  (292B): d(f32)@0 ; qs[256](i8)@4 ; bsums[16](i16)@260 (iq2 vec_dot IGNORES).
 *
 * Requires -march with zfh (hardware fcvt.s.h for the fp16 scale read), VLEN >= 128.
 */
